## Plus API runtime T1–T5 — `odd/tasks/plus-api-runtime.md` (branch `fix/pentest-script-rdd`, no commits)
- [x] T1 — `src/infrastructure/db/migrations/005_plus_schema.sql`: `challenges` (+ indexes on `user_id`, `(user_id,status)`, `status`, `expires_at`), `plus_entitlements`, `plus_users`, `plus_resources`. Additive + idempotent (`IF NOT EXISTS` only; no `DROP` / `TRUNCATE` / `DELETE FROM`). NOT applied — orchestrator runs `npx tsx src/infrastructure/db/cli.ts up`.
- [x] T1 DEVIATION (deliberate): the task listed the tables as `challenges, entitlements, plus_users, resources`. The repositories query `plus_entitlements` / `plus_resources` (each one's `initializeTable()` creates exactly that), so emitting `entitlements` / `resources` would ship two tables nothing reads while the real ones are auto-created at boot. Names the SQL actually issues win; `plus_users` already matched; `challenges` had no prior name.
- [x] T2 — `plus/infrastructure/repositories/PostgresChallengeRepository.ts`: all 7 `IChallengeRepository` methods, explicit `ChallengeProps` typing (no `any`), fully parameterised SQL, `initializeTable()` mirrors 005 column-for-column, sibling error/retry/circuit-breaker style. **`metadata.generatedPin` is stripped in `sanitizeMetadata()` on every `save`/`update` — the plaintext PIN never reaches the database.**
- [x] T3 — `plus/api/main.ts` (bootstrap: 3 Postgres repos → `startPlusServer`, `require.main === module`, non-zero exit on refused startup) + `plus/api/module-aliases.ts`. All 4 `plus/api/server.ts` errors cleared with honest fixes: `481` → `contextString(context, "challengeId") ?? ""`; `894` → static `import { createServer as createHttpsServer } from "https"`; `926` → exported `StartPlusServerOptions` where every field is optional and an omitted repo defaults to the Postgres implementation bound to `DATABASE_URL`. No `any`, no `@ts-ignore`, no casts on the error sites.
- [x] T4 — `docker/Dockerfile.plus`: builder + runtime, non-root `nodejs`, HEALTHCHECK on `:3001/health`, `CMD ["node", "dist/plus/api/main.js"]` (rootDir `.` ⇒ `dist/plus/…`, the Dockerfile.api CMD bug not repeated). Builder copies `src/` + `plus/` then `rm -rf plus/admin` — those 803 `--jsx` errors would otherwise fail `npm run build`.
